      "created_at": "2020-07-16T14:51:53Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-07-16T14:55:43Z",
      "body": "> **Edit:** #12626 & #12624 I have gone ahead and opened these 2 issues related to the suggestions I made. Let me know what you think about them.\r\n\r\nThanks for raising the issues.  I've assigned them to me and I'll look into them to improve the \"Open links in apps\" experience.  I understand that this functionality is very central to most users and it should provide privacy protection as well as convenience.  Thanks again for your contribution and I will definitely ask for your help when I start looking at the issues you created.\r\n\r\n",
